    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/84be9c9f2649c157b1810c4fd4b89613.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=154 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this laid-back management simulator, you're in charge of a store dedicated to the sale and rental of physical movies. Buy, organize, sell, rent, and improve your video store while enjoying a nostalgic experience inspired by the golden age of home entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/75573d32c36ed1812e0988d00fe805da.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which titles to add to your catalog, adjust pricing, and offer a variety of options to attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/5da5c5a1c8e0328b9c8092eb93e212ae.poster.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/5da5c5a1c8e0328b9c8092eb93e212ae.webm?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/5da5c5a1c8e0328b9c8092eb93e212ae.mp4?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/ff7fc64c409895b5649dd3125ed47536.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place your movies on the store\u2019s shelves and define the layout and display style. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/0e17f7fbed2f1ccbead792a17537d417.poster.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/0e17f7fbed2f1ccbead792a17537d417.webm?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/0e17f7fbed2f1ccbead792a17537d417.mp4?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/42380bea9724c40d1b20ab1ac7dcb2a0.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Decorate the space with unique visual elements to make your shop stand out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/605706f5a13f4e95de4cb9dad1d29089.poster.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/605706f5a13f4e95de4cb9dad1d29089.webm?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/605706f5a13f4e95de4cb9dad1d29089.mp4?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/f584b8a3b37a76b9be1c46c3a9497836.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of how many copies you have of each title, manage stock, and plan your restocks efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/cb90cbd1d57d0f7359d38c553843b191.poster.avif?t=1755571785\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/cb90cbd1d57d0f7359d38c553843b191.webm?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/cb90cbd1d57d0f7359d38c553843b191.mp4?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This version represents an early sample of the game in development. Content may be expanded or adjusted in the final release.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/84be9c9f2649c157b1810c4fd4b89613.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=154 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this laid-back management simulator, you're in charge of a store dedicated to the sale and rental of physical movies. Buy, organize, sell, rent, and improve your video store while enjoying a nostalgic experience inspired by the golden age of home entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/75573d32c36ed1812e0988d00fe805da.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which titles to add to your catalog, adjust pricing, and offer a variety of options to attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/5da5c5a1c8e0328b9c8092eb93e212ae.poster.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/5da5c5a1c8e0328b9c8092eb93e212ae.webm?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/5da5c5a1c8e0328b9c8092eb93e212ae.mp4?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/ff7fc64c409895b5649dd3125ed47536.avif?t=1755571785\" width=800 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place your movies on the store\u2019s shelves and define the layout and d