ny copies you have of each title, manage stock, and plan your restocks efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/cb90cbd1d57d0f7359d38c553843b191.poster.avif?t=1755571785\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/cb90cbd1d57d0f7359d38c553843b191.webm?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/cb90cbd1d57d0f7359d38c553843b191.mp4?t=1755571785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This version represents an early sample of the game in development. Content may be expanded or adjusted in the final release.</i></p>",
